 "text": "Hi, how have you been? It depends how much you ride and where you ride. A few hundred years is usually enough. Press enough that the valve starts to beep, but not so much that it leaks. Start with one half Bar and work your way up. That's too much. A few pumps are enough. Keep the same pressure but watch for leaks. Pop the valve and use a pumping tool if it stops working.",
